the cloture ritual should retire old prose. as should the ideate. we need more ways of formalizing that an idea is sunset. bibliothecaire exists to archive. the aesthetic is that prose reduces into the brain save for key *tattoos* messages that are so aesthetic as to stay permanent. this should follow another maxim, projects should sunset their own AI usage through their build. Organs should seek to decentralize their nervous system. this is a testable hypothesis. ganglia is a thing. the gut brain is a thing. octopuses thing with their arms.
